[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_ot6hf"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Congratz, Applicant. I am [color=3ba2f9]Martin[/color], Head of the [color=3ba2f9]Human Resource[/color]
Department here at [color=3ba2f9]String Theory[/color] Corp."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_lasuh"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "You made it to the [color=3ba2f9]technical interview[/color]. statistically, you should be
very [color=3ba2f9]proud[/color], you are in the [color=3ba2f9]top 1%[/color] of applicants."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cai31goet64bm"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_knag6"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "From your [color=3ba2f9]C.V.[/color] it seems you have enough [color=3ba2f9]experience[/color] being a pilot. Nevertheless I still need to go through some [color=3ba2f9]technicalities[/color]  about how the [color=3ba2f9]spaceship[/color] works. You know, [color=3ba2f9]protocol[/color]...
"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_eqqfy"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Oh, that was not too bad. Green [color=3ba2f9]energy[/color] is a top priority for us. We are
not just a [color=3ba2f9]company[/color], we are a disruptive emerging [color=3ba2f9]ecosystem[/color].
Do you feel ecosystemic already?"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_fh5xq"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "This particular [color=3ba2f9]engine[/color] is carbon-neutral, it works on [color=3ba2f9]gravitational[/color]
energy. Try to be gentle with it, they can be pricey and [color=3ba2f9]fragile[/color], so
we expect all pilots to handle them with care."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_ko3bd"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Okay now, time to [color=3ba2f9]pull[/color] those strings."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_eqsya"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "As you may notice this is a [color=3ba2f9]high-impact[/color] role. [color=3ba2f9]Entropy[/color] is the true
villain here, many are counting on us. Can you work [color=3ba2f9]independently[/color]
while [color=3ba2f9]chaining[/color] stars across the universe at a [color=3ba2f9]fast-pace[/color]?"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cai31goet64bm"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_fl681"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "I will introduce a [color=3ba2f9]new system[/color] now, we call it [color=3ba2f9]space leap[/color]. It is not
integrated in our ships yet but we want to make sure that new
pilots are [color=3ba2f9]capable[/color] of handling it."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cai31goet64bm"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_s27wl"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "As they say [color=3ba2f9]innovation[/color] breeds [color=3ba2f9]immersion[/color]. Show us how it is done."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cai31goet64bm"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_txfsu"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Yes, we are [color=3ba2f9]aware[/color] the interview is [color=3ba2f9]running[/color] longer than [color=3ba2f9]expected[/color].
[color=3ba2f9]Strange[/color], really, these activities were [color=3ba2f9]designed[/color] to be pretty
[color=3ba2f9]straightforward[/color]."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cai31goet64bm"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_c2v5y"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Shall we? the [color=3ba2f9]clock[/color] is still [color=3ba2f9]ticking[/color]…"
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://cai31goet64bm"

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_5nnx8"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "We are still facing some technical difficulties with the left 
thruster and on top of that now the main thruster is down."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_uaf6j"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "This is a nightmare, the core  gravitational engine seems to be
malfunctioning. The situation is critical, at the given moment the
ship has no autonomous propulsion. "

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_kyk81"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "We can only turn to the right. I wish you luck out there."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_nl5s7"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "So, we could not restore the system yet... And that is not it, more
bad news are coming..."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_kjcbh"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "We need to try something out, and for that we need to rewire and
swap the thrusters. Meaning next constellation you can only steer
to the left."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_q4nhy"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "See what you can do mate, we are all dealing with a lot at the
moment."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_qfk18"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Hi Captain, my name is Maverick the Martian, I am the second in charge
on the mechanical team. We can not get a hold of Martin, he locked
himself in his cabin room."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_p1bjy"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "I guess I am in charge over here now... Some updates: the navigation
system is not responding at all, We will need to reboot it."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_jh1j5"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Until the system reboots no manoeuvre nor propulsion would be
possible out there. Basically, the command panel would be out."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_6sldp"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Hi Captain, Maverick here. The navigation system is up again and
running. Yet something is off with the wiring of the controls..."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_wmtie"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "Unfortunately Martin is holding the gravitational engine master's
blueprints so we are unsure of how to rewire the controls back to
normal."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_shwd6"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "I am back Captain, sorry for my absence, I was feeling unwell. Thank
god my plan of rebooting the system worked."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_twlg3"]
script = ExtResource("2_8wc3g")
text = "All systems should be perfectly running by now. This last
constellation will be a piece of cake."

